      "topic_id": "bearings_cosine_rule",
      "prompt": "A ship sails from port A on a bearing of 103° for 22 km to point B. It then changes course and sails on a bearing of 318° for 9 km to point C. Find the direct distance from A to C, correct to 2 decimal places.",
